    <string name="admin_token_warning">An access token acts with its user\'s full role: an owner\'s or admin\'s token can delete every peer and key. Prefer a service user with the role you need — User only reads — and a short expiry. The token is stored encrypted on this phone and is sent only to this account\'s management server.</string>
